DOMAIN,copilotprodattachments.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoft.net
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoftapp.net
DOMAIN,sydney.bing.com

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.microsoft.com
